'''Li'l Nyandam''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]] and can be unlocked when clearing [[Saint Red Fox]], the final stage of [[Dead End Night]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] increases health, attack power, slow chance and attack rate, and gains Curse Immunity. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is guaranteed to recruit him once beating Saint Red Fox.

