==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Li'l Nyandam was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Childs Play (Removed Combo)|Childs Play]].
*Li'l Nyandam's evolution has some wordplay in Japanese: he goes from Ko Nyandam (コニャンダム, "Kid Nyandam") to Neko Nyandam (ネコニャンダム, "Cat Nyandam").
*From [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] to [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]], his [[Cat Guide]] entry incorrectly stated that he can be obtained from [[Jail Break Tunnel]].

